{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46939","headline":"闻尚颜上人剏居有寄 · 齐己","name":"闻尚颜上人剏居有寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麓山南面橘洲西，别构新斋与竹齐。\n野客已闻将鹤赠，江僧未说有诗题。\n窗临杳霭寒千嶂，枕遍潺湲月一溪。\n可想乍移禅榻处，松阴冷湿壁新泥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46939.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46939","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}